From: Ahmed Adel Wafdy <fandes99@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] fix(autoware_in_lane_mrm_planner): include the boost::hash header

boost::hash is declared in boost/container_hash/hash.hpp. Boost.Uuid 1.86
stopped including it from uuid_hash.hpp, so boost::hash<boost::uuids::uuid>
is an incomplete type. boost/functional/hash.hpp forwards to it in every
Boost release.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Ahmed Adel Wafdy <fandes99@gmail.com>
---
 src/obstacle_stop_utils.hpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/obstacle_stop_utils.hpp b/src/obstacle_stop_utils.hpp
index e1bfe97..f0d72e6 100755
--- a/src/obstacle_stop_utils.hpp
+++ b/src/obstacle_stop_utils.hpp
@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@
 #include <autoware_planning_msgs/msg/trajectory_point.hpp>
 #include <sensor_msgs/msg/point_cloud2.hpp>
 
+#include <boost/functional/hash.hpp>
 #include <boost/uuid/uuid.hpp>
 #include <boost/uuid/uuid_generators.hpp>
 #include <boost/uuid/uuid_hash.hpp>
